OL,3,APoundland collapses putting 11,000 jobs
OL,4,Aat risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoundland has collapsed into
OL,7,Fadministration, putting 11,000 jobs at
OL,8,Frisk, after its owners failed to find a
OL,9,Fbuyer to keep it in business.
OL,11,FThe retailer's shops and distribution
OL,12,Fcentres will remain open and continue
OL,13,Fto trade during the administration
OL,14,Fprocess with the business likely to be
OL,15,Fbroken up and some of its stores sold
OL,16,Foff to rival retailers.
OL,18,FPoundland's US owners held talks with
OL,19,Fseveral bidders over a last-minute
OL,20,Frescue deal for the business, but no
OL,21,Ftransaction was reached.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
